1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:01,900
Notary.

2
00:00:02,067 --> 00:00:05,100
No certificate, no money moves.

3
00:00:07,033 --> 00:00:09,667
AI agents are starting to move real money:

4
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:12,400
refunds, plan changes, credits.

5
00:00:12,433 --> 00:00:14,967
They learn how from API docs.

6
00:00:15,067 --> 00:00:18,167
But docs and real APIs disagree.

7
00:00:18,433 --> 00:00:21,133
We pointed our agent at two real APIs,

8
00:00:21,167 --> 00:00:23,467
Crustdata and Dodo Payments.

9
00:00:23,633 --> 00:00:26,033
Crustdata's own docs say a company lookup

10
00:00:26,067 --> 00:00:29,367
with no match returns an empty result.

11
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:31,933
Live, it returned an error,

12
00:00:31,967 --> 00:00:34,867
on three separate documented claims.

13
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,667
An agent that trusts the docs breaks

14
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:40,133
on exactly these cases.

15
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,067
Notary is an agent that won't touch money until

16
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,867
it has proven how its tools behave.

17
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,567
It reads the docs and turns every promise into a claim.

18
00:00:51,900 --> 00:00:54,967
Before each test call, it commits a prediction,

19
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:58,100
hashed, so it can't change afterwards.

20
00:00:58,167 --> 00:01:01,633
Then it calls the live API and compares.

21
00:01:01,733 --> 00:01:04,533
A Reflector proposes explanations.

22
00:01:04,567 --> 00:01:07,233
A stronger Adversary, running on a different

23
00:01:07,267 --> 00:01:09,767
model, tries to refute them.

24
00:01:10,067 --> 00:01:13,567
On our live runs, it narrowed all five beliefs

25
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:15,567
instead of rubber-stamping them.

26
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:19,167
What survives becomes a certificate,

27
00:01:19,400 --> 00:01:21,767
valid only where it was tested.

28
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:25,033
No certificate, no money moves:

29
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:30,033
the Guard holds anything uncovered for a person to review.

30
00:01:30,867 --> 00:01:34,133
We used neatlogs to look inside every run.

31
00:01:34,367 --> 00:01:37,600
Each run is one trace: every probe,

32
00:01:37,633 --> 00:01:40,833
every model call, every guard decision,

33
00:01:40,900 --> 00:01:42,567
labelled by agent.

34
00:01:42,933 --> 00:01:45,200
On the Crustdata run, the trace shows

35
00:01:45,233 --> 00:01:47,800
the probe for one disputed claim.

36
00:01:48,233 --> 00:01:50,033
Its prediction is logged,

37
00:01:50,067 --> 00:01:53,100
with its hash, before the call is made.

38
00:01:53,300 --> 00:01:55,633
The result came back inconclusive,

39
00:01:55,733 --> 00:01:58,400
so Notary resolved it the safe way:

40
00:01:58,467 --> 00:02:03,233
it abstained, and no payment can depend on that claim.

41
00:02:03,667 --> 00:02:07,100
Two more mismatches, lookups that error where the

42
00:02:07,133 --> 00:02:09,267
docs promise an empty result,

43
00:02:09,300 --> 00:02:10,700
are still open.

44
00:02:10,933 --> 00:02:13,133
Notary hasn't certified them,

45
00:02:13,267 --> 00:02:17,067
so the Guard won't let money depend on them either.

46
00:02:17,467 --> 00:02:22,133
On the Dodo run, the trace shows the Adversary narrowing

47
00:02:22,167 --> 00:02:26,167
four beliefs instead of upholding them as written.

48
00:02:26,500 --> 00:02:28,267
Wallet credits, for example,

49
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:31,233
are in minor units only for US dollars.

50
00:02:31,467 --> 00:02:34,833
Notary resolved those by certifying only

51
00:02:34,867 --> 00:02:37,867
the narrower scope it had proven.

52
00:02:38,700 --> 00:02:41,833
Entire captured how Notary was built.

53
00:02:42,033 --> 00:02:44,567
Seven checkpoints tie each commit to the

54
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:47,267
coding-agent session that wrote it.

55
00:02:47,600 --> 00:02:50,833
Notary also uses Entire's code graph to

56
00:02:50,867 --> 00:02:52,600
prove a safety property:

57
00:02:52,833 --> 00:02:56,900
every call that can move money goes through a guard.

58
00:02:57,100 --> 00:03:00,200
Zero unguarded call sites.

59
00:03:01,033 --> 00:03:04,233
And Notary measures what certainty costs:

60
00:03:04,433 --> 00:03:07,433
about three cents of model spend and fifteen

61
00:03:07,467 --> 00:03:10,267
Crustdata credits per live run.

62
00:03:10,700 --> 00:03:14,767
It exports those real numbers for cfo.ai

63
00:03:14,867 --> 00:03:17,600
to build the business plan on.

64
00:03:18,433 --> 00:03:22,800
On our evaluation suite, with simulated payment APIs,

65
00:03:22,967 --> 00:03:27,733
the agent without Notary made nine unsafe money moves.

66
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:32,833
With Notary, zero, and nine refunds held for review.

67
00:03:33,167 --> 00:03:34,067
Notary.

68
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:37,233
No certificate, no money moves.
